You know, it's just like rejoicing and like, man, praise God.

00:39:48.100 --> 00:39:49.400
And look at all these great things.

00:39:49.400 --> 00:39:51.960
And like, you know, he's really positive about all this stuff.

00:39:52.060 --> 00:39:54.280
But, you know, next week we're going to start chapter 2.

