00:40:10.720 --> 00:40:12.200
There should be a desperation there.

00:40:12.320 --> 00:40:15.740
God, it's not just that positive vision we're so thankful for.

00:40:15.800 --> 00:40:16.780
But God, we need you.

00:40:16.900 --> 00:40:17.740
God, we need you.

00:40:18.440 --> 00:40:19.480
There are people who are hurting.

00:40:19.600 --> 00:40:20.260
They need you.

00:40:20.340 --> 00:40:21.160
God, we need you.

00:40:21.740 --> 00:40:22.880
Can we pray with desperation?

00:40:23.600 --> 00:40:25.360
And lastly, pray with your heart.

00:40:26.220 --> 00:40:26.820
Pray with your heart.

00:40:26.860 --> 00:40:28.620
I thought about saying pray cardiacly

00:40:28.620 --> 00:40:29.680
to try to keep up the pattern,

00:40:29.780 --> 00:40:31.460
but I was like, that doesn't work very well.

00:40:33.120 --> 00:40:34.120
Pray with your heart.

00:40:35.040 --> 00:40:38.600
It's your heart that sees God working in people.

00:40:39.660 --> 00:40:42.200
It's your heart that sees the potential

00:40:42.200 --> 00:40:44.160
that God has for them.

00:40:44.160 --> 00:40:52.080
it's your heart that can see the hope and the power of God it's with your heart that your love

00:40:52.080 --> 00:40:59.640
for people will then overflow in prayer this is something like man I believe for each and every

00:40:59.640 --> 00:41:06.240
one of us here we could actually have a ministry of prayer for the lives of others that could truly

00:41:06.240 --> 00:41:13.220
like move the heavens and shape our future destinies and help us to live in the fullness of God's love

00:41:13.220 --> 00:41:14.020
and grace toward us.

00:41:14.100 --> 00:41:15.940
That's an amazing thing.

00:41:16.340 --> 00:41:16.980
Will you turn to somebody

00:41:16.980 --> 00:41:17.820
next year real quick?

00:41:17.980 --> 00:41:18.540
Will you tell them,

00:41:18.800 --> 00:41:19.900
you can have a ministry of prayer?

