is that our higher calling

00:41:27.880 --> 00:41:29.520
is to pray without ceasing

00:41:29.520 --> 00:41:30.760
as we see God working.

00:41:31.340 --> 00:41:32.260
Our higher calling

00:41:32.260 --> 00:41:33.740
is to pray without ceasing

00:41:33.740 --> 00:41:35.920
as we see God working.

