not to give them what you can offer,

00:45:43.200 --> 00:45:44.520
but one of the best things you could do

00:45:44.520 --> 00:45:45.960
for their spiritual growth and maturity

00:45:45.960 --> 00:45:47.620
is actually to pray these things for them.

00:45:48.820 --> 00:45:51.960
And so bring up those people by name to the Lord

00:45:51.960 --> 00:45:54.360
and say, God, right at this moment,

00:45:54.560 --> 00:45:56.900
I want to take your word and put it into practice.

00:45:57.560 --> 00:45:59.080
I don't just want to be a hearer of the word,

00:45:59.120 --> 00:46:00.220
I want to be a doer of the word.

00:46:01.120 --> 00:46:03.340
And so God, I'm bringing these people before you

00:46:03.340 --> 00:46:06.080
at this moment to lift them up to you in prayer.

00:46:06.780 --> 00:46:08.500
And so I wanna just give you the next couple minutes

00:46:08.500 --> 00:46:09.080
to do that.

00:46:09.180 --> 00:46:11.000
I would encourage you, again, pray with the Bible open.

00:46:11.100 --> 00:46:12.140
I would encourage you, pray out loud.

00:46:12.620 --> 00:46:14.320
Not that that makes your prayer more effective,

00:46:14.720 --> 00:46:16.640
but I think at least for me, when I pray out loud,

00:46:16.740 --> 00:46:18.240
it helps clarify my thoughts.

00:46:18.400 --> 00:46:20.400
My thoughts don't run away with me inside my head

00:46:20.400 --> 00:46:22.800
and it helps me be a little bit more focused.

00:46:23.500 --> 00:46:25.200
And so maybe just loud enough to hear your voice,

00:46:25.360 --> 00:46:27.100
pray, pray through those scriptures,

00:46:27.300 --> 00:46:28.700
pray through those verses and say,

00:46:28.760 --> 00:46:32.140
God, I'm praying this for my family, for my friends,

00:46:32.140 --> 00:46:33.820
for my Christian brothers and sisters.

00:46:34.240 --> 00:46:35.560
God, I'm gonna practice right now,

00:46:35.660 --> 00:46:36.500
lifting them up to you.

00:46:36.800 --> 00:46:37.780
Can we pray for that together?

00:46:37.920 --> 00:46:39.120
God, I pray in this moment

00:46:39.120 --> 00:46:40.340
that you would lead us

00:46:40.340 --> 00:46:42.920
in living out what we see in your word.

00:46:43.260 --> 00:46:44.460
Lead us in this moment, God,

00:46:44.540 --> 00:46:46.460
to pray for those in our lives.

00:46:46.560 --> 00:46:48.680
God, maybe some who are struggling spiritually.

00:46:48.820 --> 00:46:50.080
Maybe some who are hurting.

00:46:50.440 --> 00:46:52.520
Maybe some who are just and have a lot to grow in.

00:46:52.600 --> 00:46:54.760
Maybe some, God, that you're just working so much in

00:46:54.760 --> 00:46:56.220
that we're praying prayers of thankfulness,

00:46:56.300 --> 00:46:57.280
but we just pray for more.

00:46:57.680 --> 00:47:00.180
God, will you lead us in those prayers in this moment?

00:47:00.180 --> 00:47:11.920
And as we pray, trusting that that hope, that that power, that that inheritance are all available to us and to those we're praying for in faith through our prayers.

00:47:12.260 --> 00:47:13.380
Lead us in that now, Lord.

00:47:13.580 --> 00:47:14.620
In Jesus' name we pray.

00:47:15.060 --> 00:47:15.300
Amen.
